        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, but it is awesome when he starts punching.</p>\n<p>The Ennead was my first A/C game, and Ra obliterated. The trick is to take out Set and Atum first. The extra, guaranteed card plays aren’t as brutal as they are normally, since they all only activate once per turn, but taking out Set and getting the extra hero card plays is crucial.</p>",
