        "created_at": "2015-03-13T21:09:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Corner cases.</p>\n<p>And yes, it is different from non-challenge mode, in that it is practically mandatory, as opposed to one of many valid options normally.</p>\n<p>The thing is, Set WILL play an extra card and deal damage every turn on challenge mode. Killing him doesn’t stop the play, but it does stop the damage and gives the heroes a play, too.</p>\n<p>I’ll get my list here in a second, now that I have time.</p>",
